___ and Oliver | Mid-range prices ; 12% monthly fee for ___ | Also offers a cleaning service
Larch Furniture | Offers cheapest prices for renting furniture and ___ items | Must have own ___ ; Minimum contract length: six months
___ Rentals | See the ___ for the most up-to-date prices | ___ are allowed within 7 days of delivery

